abstract: >-
  Manuscript and curated evidence for a systematic literature review of
  decentralised, adapter-based LLM inference at the intersection of PEFT,
  P2P/federated systems and multi-task serving. Follows PRISMA 2020 reporting
  and Wohlin (2014) citation snowballing over a 123-record corpus. This release
  ships the MDPI manuscript (LaTeX), the curated G0-G6 corpus, the PRISMA
  2020 checklist, quality-appraisal scoring, and the supporting search
  exports and provenance. Licensed bibliographic source records are not
  redistributed beyond what the underlying vendors' terms permit.
